            "notes": "Basic items for round 1.\n\n[Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) is such a fun new survival item to play with. [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da)  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6).\n\n\ud83d\udcdd: If you're playing against a Freja or Pharah, picking [Protective Beam](item_3f1ef995-8ecc-45fb-8b57-26fdccc21feb) **FIRST** is extremely potent and allows your teammates to survive the immense damage that she does.\n\n\ud83d\udcdd: If you **aren't** playing vs a Freja just pick up [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb). This scales really well with the powers that this build uses and will help you build valk fast each round.",
