            "notes": "\u2705 KEEP [Chain Evoker](item_812cc89e-feb0-47d0-9e03-9d8e33a80aca).\n\n\ud83d\udcb8 Buy [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) and [Mid-Air Mobilizer](item_760c1441-8cfa-426c-885d-8d0dec32e145).\n\n\ud83d\udcdd: If you cannot afford both of those, buy [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) with [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) and [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf).\n\n\ud83d\udcdd: To get [Mid-Air Mobilizer](item_760c1441-8cfa-426c-885d-8d0dec32e145) to work, you either need to jump, GA, float, or fly around a lot. Jump is the easiest but try not to bounce around and get headshot off CD. Jump patterns are the easiest to shoot.\n\n\ud83d\udcdd: If you picked [Protective Beam](item_3f1ef995-8ecc-45fb-8b57-26fdccc21feb) in Round 1, pick [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb) this round.",
